      "lineRange": [26, 47],
      "summary": "Aggregate snapshot of host state including network interfaces, hostname, power/session info, and performance metrics (CPU, RAM, disk, network, uptime, GPU), used to detect and report system changes.",
      "tags": ["data-model", "value-object", "system-metrics"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "file:src/modules/metrics/MetricCache.h",
      "type": "file",
      "name": "MetricCache.h",
      "filePath": "src/modules/metrics/MetricCache.h",
      "summary": "Generic, thread-safe TTL cache template that stores the last computed value of an expensive metric and only recomputes it once the configured time-to-live has elapsed, plus a CacheDurations namespace of per-metric TTL constants.",
      "tags": ["utility", "caching", "template", "thread-safety"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Templated class (MetricCache<T>) using std::mutex/lock_guard for thread safety and std::chrono::steady_clock for TTL tracking; tree-sitter did not classify the template as a class definition."
    },
    {
      "id": "class:src/modules/metrics/MetricCache.h:MetricCache",
      "type": "class",
      "name": "MetricCache<T>",
      "filePath": "src/modules/metrics/MetricCache.h",
      "lineRange": [13, 85],
      "summary": "Thread-safe generic cache that lazily recomputes a value via a supplied function once its TTL expires, used to throttle expensive metric collection (e.g., GPU info, disk space).",
      "tags": ["caching", "template", "thread-safety", "utility"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
